{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_034C20","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，说说你的看法。敌方佣兵的实力如何？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":59,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"训练水平无可挑剔，人数也绰绰有余，而且久经实战。很多人应该是从越南回来的，是难缠的对手。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":132,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"装备也很充足。能以那种规模运用坦克和攻击直升机的佣兵部队可不多见。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"也就是说，他们资金充裕。而且还有门路能弄到那种大型兵器。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"有大名鼎鼎的CIA在背后撑腰，当然了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"相比之下，我们这边一半是农民，一半是学生，还有<R=孩子,CHICO>，就连武器都得从敌人手里抢来凑数。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=孩子,CHICO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":136,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"不甘心，但我们从头到尾都处于下风。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"是啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"连我们倚仗的<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>也失去了……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":58,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"是啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"……我们能赢吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"Snake，你怎么看？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":23,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"没信心吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"可是……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"Amanda。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"什么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"听好了，在同伴面前绝不能用这种语气说话。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"……啊？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"你是领导者。领导者无论何时都必须挺直腰杆。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"不管你承受着怎样的痛苦，哪怕快被不安和恐惧压垮也一样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"要让伙伴和部下感到你坚如磐石、可以依靠。这就是领导者的职责。别忘了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"……Snake。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":14,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"想要安慰就去教堂。我没什么可再说的了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"也是。对不起。我得振作起来才行。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"嗯。你做得到。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"谢谢你，Snake。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":20,"review_flag":""}]}